t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c7c544 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7c7c544\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97d6084 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"97d6084\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a5b361 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3a5b361\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"108\" src=\"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Logo-01.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-17021\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Logo-01.png 600w, https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Logo-01-150x27.png 150w, https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Logo-01-400x72.png 400w, https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Logo-01-220x39.png 220w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98d830b elementor-widget__width-initial wd-width-100 elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_title\" data-id=\"98d830b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_title.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper set-mb-s reset-last-child wd-title-color-primary wd-title-style-default wd-title-size-large text-left\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-subtitle subtitle-color-primary subtitle-style-default wd-fontsize-xs\">\n\t\t\t\t\tPrecision Redefined, Excellence Delivered\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"liner-continer\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"woodmart-title-container title wd-fontsize-xxl\">About Us<\/h4> \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-after_title set-cont-mb-s reset-last-child wd-fontsize-s\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"color: #de7e5d\">Welcome to Central India Export<\/span><\/h3><p>Since 1985, Central India Export has been a trusted name in the global export market, specializing in medical equipment, hospital supplies, ophthalmic instruments, orthopedic implants, laboratory equipment, and scientific educational products. With decades of experience and dedication to quality, we have established ourselves as India\u2019s recognized export house, serving clients across continents.<\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #de7e5d\">Our Commitment to Excellence<\/span><\/h3><p>At Central India Export, we are committed to providing our customers with a seamless experience from order placement to product installation. Our logistics department ensures timely delivery of goods using the best available carriers, guaranteeing prompt and efficient service.<\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #de7e5d\">Global Reach and OEM Services<\/span><\/h3><p>Our reach extends to all corners of the globe, with customers in Europe, America, Canada, Africa, Latin America, and Central America. We offer OEM manufacturing services to clients in developed countries, producing goods under their brand names while adhering to strict quality standards such as CE, FDA, GMP, and ISO certifications.<\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #de7e5d\">Quality Assurance<\/span><\/h3><p>Quality is our top priority. Every product undergoes rigorous inspections by our quality control department, and only those meeting our stringent standards receive the HEMC hologram\u2014a symbol of our commitment to delivering superior quality. Unlike some competitors, we maintain universal quality standards for all customers, ensuring reliability and safety in every product.<\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #de7e5d\">Our Promise<\/span><\/h3><p>At Central India Export, we are grateful for the trust and support of our customers. We look forward to continuing to serve you with the same dedication and excellence that has been our hallmark for over three decades. Thank you for choosing Central India Export\u2014we are here to meet your medical equipment needs, wherever you are in the world.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3eef7d8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3eef7d8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cee0b0c elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"cee0b0c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: var(--text-align); background-color: var(--wd-main-bgcolor); color: #de7e5d;\"><b><i>Connect with us-<\/i><\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee232e9 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-hidden-phone elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_social_buttons\" data-id=\"ee232e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_social_buttons.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\" wd-social-icons icons-design-colored-alt icons-size-small color-scheme-dark soc